{
  "title": "Further synthetic investigation of the general lanthanoid(III) [Ln(III)]/copper(II)/pyridine-2,6-dimethanol/carboxylate reaction system: {CuII5LnIII4} coordination clusters (Ln = Dy, Tb, Ho) and their yttrium(III) analogue",
